    "Original penalty: **5 years** or **Rs 1 lakh**; **Rs 5,000/day**; decriminalised by **Jan Vishwas Act 2023**",
    "**Sec 16**: EP Fund (Public Account); **75%** States, **25%** Centre",
    "**Art 48A** (State) & **51A(g)** (citizens): **42nd Amendment 1976**"
